B. PROOF AUDITS -- D2 (E-lin theorem):
   - Theorem A (LIFT): CONFIRMED.  Algebra re-proved on 400 random blocks;
     data check on an INDEPENDENT instance (R=128 ruleB D0=0 lifted +1/+3,
     full fresh verification).
   - Theorem B: CONFIRMED with one off-by-one FINDING.  i_feed formula ==
