C. PROOF AUDITS -- D3 (golden transient bound):
   - G1 (alternation-transport calculus): CONFIRMED -- transport identity,
     zero-sum, defect-mass L1 law (400 fresh random trials each), ratio law
     (rho-1)^(1+delta) exact with rho = 2 marginal, and the counterexample
